  "description": "IKAQES crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H67 Er3 N20 O6. From the CIF bond table, Er1A (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er2A (Er) has 2 O neighbors; Er3A (Er) has 3 O neighbors; Er1B (Er) has 5 O neighbors; Er2B (Er) has 2 O neighbors; Er3B (Er) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.583-3.861 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.08-112.08°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C92H67Er3N20O6. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
